Ported from open Lichii PR #215 (https://github.com/zortos293/Lichii/pull/215): before a macro
DMA read, wait for the query reports that still wait for host results (OoT white flashes).
Adapted: our core has no GpuSplit::Run or FlushDeferred; the wait is bounded at 200 ms.

